1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:02,035
"If you still are miserable
after everything

2
00:00:02,035 --> 00:00:03,469
then that's just who you are."

3
00:00:04,504 --> 00:00:06,106
He just showed up

4
00:00:06,106 --> 00:00:07,707
and dumped me
with those words.

5
00:00:09,843 --> 00:00:11,763
You bastard. You're the
one that chased after me.

6
00:00:19,586 --> 00:00:20,586
Eun-ho.

7
00:00:22,722 --> 00:00:23,722
Did you see all that?

8
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,191
Yeah...

9
00:00:25,191 --> 00:00:26,191
And heard all that?

10
00:00:28,395 --> 00:00:29,629
About the debt?

11
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:38,671
He was awful.

12
00:00:39,005 --> 00:00:41,107
You're better off without him.

13
00:00:48,448 --> 00:00:49,549
What you saw today...

14
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:50,784
Don't worry.

15
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:51,784
I'm not telling anyone.

16
00:00:54,788 --> 00:00:56,089
Do you want me to
get you a guy?

17
00:00:57,323 --> 00:00:58,525
I'm done with dating now.

18
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:00,894
Why are you being
casual with me?

19
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:02,429
That's how I got close
to Hye-won.

20
00:01:02,429 --> 00:01:03,429
You started it.

21
00:01:03,797 --> 00:01:04,797
You little brat!
